# needs typographic-palette-bar.scm: Format > Colour from the menu bar (col:
# "Palette: Classical", the standard grid), "Earth" chosen in the list of
# the palettes (on: its colours in the open menu, which moves up if it no
# longer fits), then "Classical" (off: the grid of before). The refresh
# asked for in the menu reaches the editor window (windows_refresh), which
# no other window opens. Positions for the default window of the test home.
wait 6000
window No name
click 231 15
wait 900
move 242 275
wait 1200
snapshot col
move 400 280
wait 300
move 505 311
wait 300
click 505 311
wait 900
click 460 385
wait 1500
snapshot on
click 505 311
wait 900
click 472 331
wait 1500
snapshot off
